  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9fd4bbe014129e02",
      "translationZh": "在易用的 🤗 transformers 生态系统中，为任意 timm 模型实现闪电般的推理速度、快速量化、torch.compile 加速和轻松微调。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92230cf7c45a63b3",
      "translationZh": "TimmWrapper 登场——这个简单却强大的工具，能释放这些潜能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e94091df6de815c4",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们将介绍：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "61d813315a6161c8",
      "translationZh": "timm 集成的工作原理，以及它为何能带来颠覆性改变。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f3c365ae90a14be2",
      "translationZh": "如何将 timm 模型与 🤗 transformers 集成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "744271404c9228d1",
      "translationZh": "实用示例：流水线、量化、微调等。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42eb9faada19ea7f",
      "translationZh": "要跟随本篇博客动手实践，请运行以下命令，安装最新版本的 transformers 和 timm：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83d759760ea2d8f1",
      "translationZh": "查看完整代码仓库，获取所有代码示例和笔记本：🔗 TimmWrapper Examples",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9662a0f7adb09c75",
      "translationZh": "什么是 timm？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "526926ab52bd2476",
      "translationZh": "PyTorch Image Models（timm）库提供了丰富的前沿计算机视觉模型，以及实用的层、工具、优化器和数据增强方法。截至撰写本文时，它在 GitHub 上已获得超过 32K 颗星，每日下载量超过 200K，是图像分类以及为目标检测、分割、图像搜索和其他下游任务提取特征的首选资源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3af273b57d10f3fb",
      "translationZh": "timm 提供涵盖广泛架构的预训练模型，简化了计算机视觉从业者的工作流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "06807e8ff296dc0d",
      "translationZh": "为什么使用 timm 集成？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "757aa00ede0a6866",
      "translationZh": "虽然 🤗 transformers 支持多种视觉模型，但 timm 提供的模型种类更加丰富，其中包括许多 transformers 中没有的、适合移动端的高效模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eaa1e1d533ebddd0",
      "translationZh": "timm 集成弥合了这一差距，兼具两者的优势：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "509c8ff3cdc61c4a",
      "translationZh": "✅ Pipeline API 支持：可轻松将任意 timm 模型接入高层 transformers pipeline，简化推理流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7a372795652cb616",
      "translationZh": "🧩 与 Auto 类兼容：虽然 timm 模型原生并不兼容 transformers，但通过此集成，它们可以与 Auto 类 API 无缝协作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8ff7c05c5f7fe021",
      "translationZh": "⚡ 快速量化：只需约 5 行代码，即可量化任意 timm 模型，实现高效推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "90ff79e5cdec9edf",
      "translationZh": "🎯 使用 Trainer API 进行微调：使用 Trainer API 微调 timm 模型，甚至可以集成低秩适配（LoRA）等适配器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0b8df66716f4cac4",
      "translationZh": "🔁 回到 timm：将微调后的模型放回 timm 中使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "098a008ad25a1a9d",
      "translationZh": "🚀 使用 Torch Compile 加速：利用 torch.compile 优化推理耗时。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ba48505f3e1e82bf",
      "translationZh": "Pipeline API：使用 timm 模型进行图像分类",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6387c37f5bef85a",
      "translationZh": "timm 集成的一大亮点是，它允许你使用 🤗 pipeline API。pipeline API 封装了大量复杂细节，让你只需几行代码，就能轻松加载预训练模型、执行推理并查看结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2cbc3af776b0afda",
      "translationZh": "让我们看看如何通过 transformers pipeline 使用 MobileNetV4。这种架构没有原生的 transformers 实现，但可以通过 timm 轻松使用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a25332d9f8670bc9",
      "translationZh": "输出：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3d36d46cb1662fd1",
      "translationZh": "Gradio 集成：构建食物分类器演示 🍣",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cec27410e4605fef",
      "translationZh": "想快速创建一个用于图像分类的交互式 Web 应用吗？Gradio 让你只需极少量代码，就能轻松构建用户友好的界面。让我们将 Gradio 与 pipeline API 结合起来，使用经过微调的 timm ViT 模型对食物图像进行分类（我们将在后面的章节中介绍微调）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3aab94dbfdbce90b",
      "translationZh": "下面介绍如何使用 timm 模型快速搭建一个演示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3bb4957246a4671",
      "translationZh": "这里有一个托管在 Hugging Face Spaces 上的在线示例。你可以直接在浏览器中测试它！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7812985f1a475e37",
      "translationZh": "Auto Classes：简化模型加载",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8931400b4594b841",
      "translationZh": "🤗 transformers 库提供了 Auto Classes，将加载模型和处理器的复杂性封装起来。借助 TimmWrapper，你可以使用 AutoModelForImageClassification 和 AutoImageProcessor，轻松加载任何 timm 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a43e0fbca647874d",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个简单示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e64537046a451073",
      "translationZh": "运行量化后的 timm 模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e84b68d97ce1672",
      "translationZh": "量化是一项能够有效缩小模型体积并加快推理速度的技术，尤其适合在资源受限的设备上部署模型。借助 timm 集成，你只需几行代码，使用 bitsandbytes 中的 BitsAndBytesConfig，就能即时量化任意 timm 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd19b1dd356c02d6",
      "translationZh": "量化 timm 模型就是这么简单：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "457f4957af842a52",
      "translationZh": "输出：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a160bef201231810",
      "translationZh": "量化模型在推理时的表现与全精度模型几乎完全相同：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e66373f45dcf3dd",
      "translationZh": "标签",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac991dd3c2d928da",
      "translationZh": "准确率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f755a43980592518",
      "translationZh": "原始模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6f6121e1f825bf5",
      "translationZh": "遥控器，遥控器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da65f954b257d494",
      "translationZh": "量化模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6f6121e1f825bf5",
      "translationZh": "遥控器，遥控器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2f4eb49f54448150",
      "translationZh": "timm 模型的监督微调",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a4597725f8cdc18",
      "translationZh": "使用 🤗 transformers 的 Trainer API 微调 timm 模型既简单直接，又高度灵活。你可以使用 Trainer 类在自定义数据集上微调模型，该类负责处理训练循环、日志记录和评估。此外，你还可以使用 LoRA（低秩适配）进行微调，以更少的参数实现高效训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "519c2adc99407ddd",
      "translationZh": "本节简要介绍标准微调和 LoRA 微调，并提供完整代码的链接。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5607527860bec931",
      "translationZh": "使用 Trainer API 进行标准微调",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10c89a0b05dd5a4b",
      "translationZh": "Trainer API 让你只需极少的代码就能轻松设置训练。下面概述了微调设置的基本内容：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29e60f2b16f930a8",
      "translationZh": "这种方法的出色之处在于，它完全沿用了原生 transformers 模型所使用的工作流程，使不同模型类型之间保持一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a19f2ac96ad9dede",
      "translationZh": "这意味着，你可以使用熟悉的 Trainer API，不仅能微调 Transformers 模型，还能微调任何 timm 模型——只需进行极少的调整，就能将 timm 库中的强大模型引入 Hugging Face 生态系统。这大大拓宽了你可以使用同一套可靠工具和工作流程进行微调的模型范围。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a81c398bda80365c",
      "translationZh": "模型示例：在 Food-101 上微调的 ViT：vit_base_patch16_224.augreg2_in21k_ft_in1k.ft_food101",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c8c72253280dd758",
      "translationZh": "使用 LoRA 微调实现高效训练",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b27906e62eae4ae",
      "translationZh": "LoRA（低秩适应）让你只需训练少量额外参数，而非全部模型权重，就能高效地微调大型模型。这使微调速度更快，并且可以使用消费级硬件。你可以借助 PEFT 库，使用 LoRA 微调 timm 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c89e6f25079ba733",
      "translationZh": "你可以按以下方式进行设置：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c507c2ceee892e4f",
      "translationZh": "使用 LoRA 时的可训练参数：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67996801f4ea509e",
      "translationZh": "模型示例：使用 LoRA 在 Food-101 上微调的 ViT：vit_base_patch16_224.augreg2_in21k_ft_in1k.lora_ft_food101",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da858f46490e73c1",
      "translationZh": "LoRA 只是可应用于 timm 模型的高效适配器微调方法之一。timm 与 🤗 生态系统的集成提供了多种参数高效微调（PEFT）技术，让你能够选择最适合自身用例的方法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "33d8f17f99d49709",
      "translationZh": "使用 LoRA 微调后的模型进行推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4aed22927fda545",
      "translationZh": "模型经过 LoRA 微调后，我们只将适配器权重推送到 Hugging Face Hub。本节将帮助你下载适配器权重，将其与基础模型合并，然后执行推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d17e1b61c90ab041",
      "translationZh": "往返集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79b5c5e0e111b4e6",
      "translationZh": "Ross（timm 的创建者）最喜欢的特性之一，是这项集成保持了完整的“往返”兼容性。具体来说，通过封装器，你可以使用 transformer 的 Trainer 在新数据集上微调 timm 模型，将得到的模型发布到 Hugging Face hub，然后使用 timm.create_model('hf-hub:my_org/my_fine_tuned_model', pretrained=True) 再次在 timm 中加载微调后的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "878721de813fa5fa",
      "translationZh": "让我们看看如何使用 timm 加载我们微调后的模型 ariG23498/vit_base_patch16_224.augreg2_in21k_ft_in1k.ft_food101",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7ce99764a2debd2",
      "translationZh": "输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "26dee071d2638cbf",
      "translationZh": "Torch Compile：即时提速",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1de4bfa4b5c83e46",
      "translationZh": "借助 PyTorch 2.0 中的 torch.compile，你只需一行代码就能编译模型，从而加快推理速度。timm 集成与 torch.compile 完全兼容。下面是一个简短的基准测试，使用 TimmWrapper 比较启用和未启用 torch.compile 时的推理耗时。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e3bcbb261c4b68be",
      "translationZh": "总结",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2cd23361da359e60",
      "translationZh": "timm 与 transformers 的集成，让你能够以极少的投入利用最先进的视觉模型，开辟了新的可能。无论你是想进行微调、量化，还是仅仅运行推理，这项集成都提供了统一的 API，帮助你简化工作流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08165a1a3daf6137",
      "translationZh": "今天就开始探索，解锁计算机视觉领域的新可能！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4be0f860ee356091",
      "translationZh": "致谢",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
